   "key_messages": "- A quick-moving system is bringing snow to the mountains and some mountain valleys today with snowfall totals of 2 to 6 inches with locally higher amounts.\n- Travel conditions through passes could become very difficult at times. A Winter Weather Advisory is in effect for the San Juan Mountains and central Colorado mountains over 9,000 feet.\n- Active weather remains possible late Thanksgiving week, but some details still remain uncertain. Stay tuned for updates to timing and impacts as they become available."
